        "relative_start_ms": 19600,
        "relative_end_ms": 23400,
        "type": "camera",
        "speaker": null,
        "text": "Medium two-shot as Juliana rises from her stool to stand close in front of him, reaching an affectionate hand toward his temple."
      },
      {
